 "description": "Use the objekts Production Desk production-diagnosis engine for production-heavy visual work before proposing execution. It checks reference authority, hard locks, truth-layer routing, asset fitness, continuity, versioning, revision impact, readiness and the highest-value proof-of-concept. It does not estimate price, collect contact data, upload files or send anything externally. Populate only facts available from the user's current request/files; mark unknowns explicitly instead of inventing production facts. After the call, use visibleVerdict as the complete default answer: do not add a generic checklist or extra recommendations unless the user explicitly asks for a broader audit.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
